     "html": "<strong>데하카:</strong> The Talent tooltip for Lurker Strain's now correctly states that Stealth is granted upon emerging from Burrow.<strong>데하카:</strong> The Essence Collection Ability tooltip now correctly lists a 5 second cooldown.",
